sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Student
    participant Route as Student Content Route
    participant Auth as Identity Adapter
    participant Identity as Module 1 Identity
    participant Policy as Course Authorization Policy
    participant Course as Course Permission Adapter
    participant Modules as Module Retrieval

    Note over Route,Course: External integrations pending verification

    Student->>Route: GET student modules
    Route->>Auth: Authenticate request
    Auth->>Identity: Validate session
    Identity-->>Auth: Identity result

    alt Invalid or missing session
        Auth-->>Route: Authentication denied
        Route-->>Student: 401 Unauthorized
    else Valid active student
        Auth-->>Route: Authenticated student
        Route->>Policy: Authorize course access
        Policy->>Course: Check course and enrollment
        Course-->>Policy: Permission result

        alt Course not found
            Policy-->>Route: Course not found
            Route-->>Student: 404 Not Found
        else Student not enrolled
            Policy-->>Route: Access denied
            Route-->>Student: 403 Forbidden
        else Permission lookup fails
            Policy-->>Route: Service unavailable
            Route-->>Student: 503 Service Unavailable
        else Student authorized
            Policy-->>Route: Access granted
            Route->>Modules: Get accessible modules
            Note over Modules: Existing retrieval path, SQLite integration pending
            Modules-->>Route: Published and visible modules
            Route-->>Student: 200 OK with modules array
        end
    end